/// hide the text around them: zero-width characters, the bidirectional
/// overrides and isolates, the Arabic letter mark, the interlinear annotation
/// anchors, the tag characters (the standard ASCII-smuggling vector), and the
/// byte-order mark. Control characters are handled separately by
